description:
We are seeking a talented and experienced Database Architect to join our international development team. You will work on development of solutions for various industries such as news and media, sports and talent management, fashion and entertainment, and others.

Responsibilities
Manage company's databases and implement database architectural changes to make database infrastructure highly scalable and optimized;
Creating and implementing data management processes and procedures;
Analyze the existing data systems and processes to identify areas that need improvement;
Ensure that new database code meets company standards for readability, reliability, and performance;
Develop or maintain archived procedures, procedural codes, or queries for applications;
Design indexes for existing applications;
Advise developers on the most efficient database designs;

Requirements
Other knowledge
Microsoft SQL Server - Advanced
SQL Server Integration Services (SSIS) - Advanced
Database management - Advanced
Microsoft SQL Server administration - Advanced
Data mining - Advanced

Number of years of experience
10+

Personality requirements and skills
Motivated to share knowledge in a team environment;
Excellent interpersonal, analytical, and problem solving skills;
Expert level experience with Microsoft SQL Server
Familiarity with SSI packages for integration and execution of the stored procedure.
Strong database programming experience, including query optimization, data modeling, and performance tuning.
Experience with SQL Server Integration Services (SSIS) and SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS)
Experience with data migration projects
